<title>USA: IMM currency futures close mixed.</title>
<headline>IMM currency futures close mixed.</headline>
<text>
<p>June 17 - IMM currency futures closed mixed in rangebound trade. Traders are awaiting Japan's May trade surplus data on Tuesday at 1950 EDT/2350 GMT. Sept yen is expected to hold support at $0.008904. Resistance is at $0.008957. Redbook's U.S. adj retail sales rose 1.7 pct in week ended June 14. ((DerivativesDesk(312)408-8750))</p>
